nal Student Service System\" (\nhttps://bnu.17gz.org/\n) to make reservation. Please see registration instruction: https://iso.bnu.edu.cn/cn/download/download?id=114\n2. Bookings will not be accepted after the deadline. Accommodation will be arranged according to the student's last choice during the booking period.\n3. Students who have received the full scholarship from the Chinese Government, the International Chinese Teacher Scholarship (excluding the New Chinese Studies Program), and the scholarship program includes on-campus accommodation will be arranged by the school to stay in Lanhui Apartment. In case of change, the latest notice shall prevail.\nAtlas\nAbout us\nAbout Beijing\nAbout BNU\nAbout ISO\nFamous Professors\nStudy & Life\nOrientation\nStudents Association\nFacilities\nInternship & Employment\nCopyright © 2016 Beijing Normal University. All rights reserved\nTechnical Support:\nCUCAS"
